steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352260/extras/7649b1c9733ba6d3008c93ac656f8af4.poster.avif?t=1748940716\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352260/extras/7649b1c9733ba6d3008c93ac656f8af4.webm?t=1748940716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352260/extras/7649b1c9733ba6d3008c93ac656f8af4.mp4?t=1748940716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxing Yet Addictive:</strong> Easy to pick up, but tricky to master—<i>Spire Blast</i> offers a soothing puzzle experience with layers of depth for those who want to truly perfect their strategy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352260/extras/b3d127b7cc5cad020ed32078fae49954.poster.avif?t=1748940716\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352260/extras/b3d127b7cc5cad020ed32078fae49954.webm?t=1748940716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352260/extras/b3d127b7cc5cad020ed32078fae49954.mp4?t=1748940716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vibrant Visuals &amp; Sound:</strong> Enjoy colorful, minimalist art and a calming soundtrack that perfectly complements the satisfying destruction of the tower.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you bring the Spire down to its foundations? Test your logic, timing, and creativity in this unique puzzle challenge!</p>", "short_description": "Spire Blast is a unique physics-based puzzle game in which you match colors, shoot and blast towers. Step into the colourful world of Spire Blast. Work with your ever-hungry dragon companion to collapse nume